        <div class="afx-suite-top">
          <img src="/img/nsm-icon.png" alt="NSM Docs" class="afx-suite-logo">
          <span class="afx-suite-tab-pill">docs.nsm &nearr;</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Home - NSM Documentation</h3>
        <p>Complete NSM client manual, dedicated server setup guide, Lua/JS/C# scripting reference, and searchable Native Reference.</p>
